{
  "comment": "Git config keys (as printed by `git config --name-only`) that can make git EXECUTE a command during a read-only proof (status/ls-remote). A repository whose local or worktree config sets any of them is blocked with repo_config_can_execute. Run by crates/sj-core (executable_config_key).",
